1
00:00:00,376 --> 00:00:01,776
(Sheldon:)Oh.

2
00:00:01,945 --> 00:00:05,405
(Raj:)I always thought if I had a white name,
it would be Gavin.

3
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:10,450
- Keep reading. What does it say?
- No, I don't know if I should.

4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,490
(Raj:)If she wanted me to know about her blog,
she would've told me.

5
00:00:13,656 --> 00:00:17,526
(Raj:)- It's almost like I'm reading her diary.
- It's exactly what it's like. Keep reading.

6
00:00:18,228 --> 00:00:19,698
(Raj:)No, this is creepy.

7
00:00:19,896 --> 00:00:24,386
(Howard:)Oh... I think we were looking at creepy in the
rearview mirror when I put up that camera.

8
00:00:25,235 --> 00:00:29,065
(Raj:)It's not creepy. Don't listen to him.

9
00:00:29,239 --> 00:00:33,339
Ooh, who's got the sweetest kisses?

10
00:00:41,918 --> 00:00:43,548
(Howard:)Should I go?

11
00:00:48,758 --> 00:00:52,088
(Leonard:)With all the TV Sheldon was talking about,
I had the greatest idea ever.

12
00:00:52,295 --> 00:00:58,025
It blows away my idea for a Star Wars-themed
coffee shop called Brewbacca's.

